version: "0.1.3-beta"
date-released: "2026-08-25"
url: "https://ai-risk-oracle.fly.dev/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/InterAILabs/ai-risk-oracle"
abstract: >-
  Independent pre-execution decision layer for consequential agent actions.
  InterAI evaluates a proposed action under authoritative policy before the
  surrounding execution layer routes, escalates, or aborts it, and can issue
  durable trust receipts as decision evidence.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - pre-execution-verification
  - policy-enforcement
  - trust-receipts
  - mcp
